  s0 --> s2: look for CodexBarCLI
  s1 --> s3: you press Later or you press Download (opens CodexBar page)
  s2 --> s0: app launches again
  s3 --> s0: app launches again
  s1 --> s2: look for CodexBarCLI
  class s0 blue
  class s1 orange
  class s2 teal
  class s3 tan
